# Evidence raw bundles (docs/analysis/*-raw/) are byte-for-byte copies of files
# captured on the machine that ran a trial. SOURCES.json records the sha256 of each
# copy, so Git must not translate line endings when storing or checking them out:
# with core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) the staged instruction file
# is turned back into LF on commit and the recorded digest stops recomputing.
docs/analysis/*-raw/** -text
docs/analysis/*-raw/* -text
